{"title":"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1.5_(People_who_don&#39;t_know_how_to_do_the_area_of_a_sector)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1.5 (People who don't know how to do the area of a sector)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/746fe6b6679f693c884c68a86c6dabd02ee2c299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=3$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/0/c002226460bd25f6625e58553da55243c2aaf4a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DA=5$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />. A circle of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is centered at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, a circle of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is centered at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and a circle of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is centered at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Which of the following is closest to the area of the region inside the rectangle but outside all three circles?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e531c5a59c1c4eec0d30c2a3e6ca52cd6bfe139a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(5,0)--(5,3)--(0,3)--(0,0)); draw(Circle((0,0),1)); draw(Circle((0,3),2)); draw(Circle((5,3),3)); label(&quot;A&quot;,(0.2,0),W); label(&quot;B&quot;,(0.2,2.8),NW); label(&quot;C&quot;,(4.8,2.8),NE); label(&quot;D&quot;,(5,0),SE); label(&quot;5&quot;,(2.5,0),N); label(&quot;3&quot;,(5,1.5),E); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"178\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/b/a3bf120445c7c4cd7c765796a3b5998b489654a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }3.5\\qquad\\text{(B) }4.0\\qquad\\text{(C) }4.5\\qquad\\text{(D) }5.0\\qquad\\text{(E) }5.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"403\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area in the rectangle but outside the circles is the area of the rectangle minus the area of all three of the quarter circles in the rectangle.\n</p><p>The area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/7/a679d1debe8a0646fbe6d321360d3b06357d250e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot5 =15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />. The area of all 3 quarter circles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7df972702555a26ff6c5eb7d2308d2e76a975886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\frac{\\pi(2)^2}{4}+\\frac{\\pi(3)^2}{4} = \\frac{14\\pi}{4} = \\frac{7\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"255\" height=\"39\" />. Therefore the area in the rectangle but outside the circles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/238f8eb955b5cdf6923b9b457d9973bb9e886476.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15-\\frac{7\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"37\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8bb70286c4fa84b07269ec271786cd9c6714ad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{22}{7},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"26\" height=\"37\" /> and substituting that in will give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/b/49b434cce28b81ddd21648acb121e4d2364c07c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15-11=\\boxed{\\text{(B) }4.0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1.5_.28People_who_don.27t_know_how_to_do_the_area_of_a_sector.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.5_(People_who_don't_know_how_to_do_the_area_of_a_sector)\">Solution 1.5 (People who don't know how to do the area of a sector)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.5 (People who don&#39;t know how to do the area of a sector)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Instead of calculating the area of the rectangle minus the area of the 3 quarter-circles that are in it, we calculate the \n</p><p>area of the 3 circles, not just the quarter-circles. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e18121eb994e49cd8ef8a53e2825ef57a3185.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2eddbf4a36b15c84cd5a99fb11d9817bc2978d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9\\pi$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/3/843eee6e7e059c82aa03de809937af0f7f3827fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\" /> squared is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72a1caa0cb9e0f72f414ebd8180ea676808568f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" />, and \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54d74b18224373512e2d7cd61ac3a9638d1e29a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\" /> is equal to 1. It is obvious that they are all quarter-circles, as mentioned in solution 1, so you divide each of \n</p><p>them by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So they become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/2/dd202ffe6b1702c8d532890d913c3866c2d366fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{4}\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"26\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/d/d5de598861d2ee80dc5debded662bb289995ddf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"23\" height=\"37\" />. Adding them together, it's <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/9195dbda989f962e203a87f985a22b6e7cc69aaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14}{4}\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"35\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Now you can calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/1/f21fe60630822f04e58a6da2971bda48848f5bb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15-\\frac{14}{4}\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" />, and you'll get around <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/9/7e92316bc0a6f8d19acce610cd8f9864229b1aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.00000000000001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" />, which is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/9/d099f3cd1ce5fcee663a94c6813da6d9bfc861a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B) }4.0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/e4gDE2uLQ6A\">https://youtu.be/e4gDE2uLQ6A</a> ~DSA_Catachu\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EPILwH5iA9Q\">https://youtu.be/EPILwH5iA9Q</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/j3QSD5eDpzU?t=2327\">https://youtu.be/j3QSD5eDpzU?t=2327</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8\">2014 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017145651\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 222/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2272/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5668/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.105      1 -total\n 57.63%    6.976      1 Template:AMC8_box\n 40.63%    4.918      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13845:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017145651 and revision id 274938. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}